Hello,

An example (where the error is reproducible) input would be:

NC_007070.3 860 + CG 0.200 10
NC_007070.3 909 + CG 0.091 11
NC_007070.3 2591 + CG 0.333 6
NC_007070.3 2654 + CG 0.143 7
NC_007070.3 4082 - CG 0.077 13
NC_007070.3 4144 - CG 0.091 11
NC_007070.3 8868 + CG 0.067 15
NC_007070.3 8939 + CG 0.083 12
NC_007070.3 11930 - CG 0.167 6
NC_007070.3 15964 - CG 0.100 10

where col 1 is Chr, 2 is location, 3 is strand, 4 is context, 5 is ratio and 6 is total sites.

Or to download the file: Download_BSMap_sample_file <https://drive.google.com/file/d/0Bx7gmgQsibuPaHEwaXNLaGdELWs/view?usp=sharing>

The input is:
Test=methRead("testBSmap",sample.id <http://sample.id>="test",assembly="45", header=FALSE, context="CpG", resolution="base",pipeline=list(fraction=TRUE, chr.col=1, start.col=2,end.col=2,coverage.col=6,strand.col=3,freqC.col=5))

 and the output I get is:

Error in `[.data.frame`(data, , coverage.col) :

  undefined columns selected

Thank you!
Ethan

